    <title>损失最小化 vs. 收益最大化：男女相亲中的心理攻防</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65cb29ef35dd8780edc217ce</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65cb29ef35dd8780edc217ce</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 13 Feb 2024 13:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期邀请了</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/64a18f6db017be04777f7ec1" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/64a18f6db017be04777f7ec1"><span>《双响屁》</span></a><span>的两位主播，从男女各异的视角出发，聊一聊传统线下相亲市场。</span></p><span></span><p><span>豆子作为单身美女，实地前往杭州相亲角带来有趣的观察记录；Yewei 分享了她在苏北老家和香港双重婚恋约会市场穿梭的经历；曹老板则被两位女嘉宾从相亲市场估值的角度好好女凝了一番。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎微信搜索 straightsbeaker 加听友群</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="279">04:39</a> &nbsp;嘉宾豆子作为单身美女的杭州相亲角见闻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="441">07:21</a> &nbsp;「短婚」、「原生态家庭」：相亲角公告上都有哪些别致用词</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="671">11:11</a> &nbsp;187、P7、无房有车：曹老板如果挂牌相亲市场，估值几何？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1013">16:53</a> &nbsp;豆子：女方条件如何曹老板你才愿意做上门女婿？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1076">17:56</a> &nbsp;男生173 就够用？本地婚恋市场和 Tinder 生态大不同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1267">21:07</a> &nbsp;30 岁之后就焦虑？两位女嘉宾对女性婚恋年龄的思考</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1518">25:18</a> &nbsp;排队面试的匹配游戏：老家的相亲生态 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1640">27:20</a> &nbsp;Yewei的香港婚恋市场观察</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2208">36:48</a> &nbsp;可以用聊得来这一标准大致判断彼此家境相当吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2710">45:10</a> &nbsp;不做输家 vs. 狩猎心态：男女相亲的心理攻防</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2909">48:29</a> &nbsp;曹老板：女生选择短期伴侣时要求更苛刻，男性相反</span></p>]]></description>
