  <item>
    <title>通过做播客找到了女朋友？开播一周年，三直男谈被播客改变的生活</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/649c371aba16d4cb984070b1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">649c371aba16d4cb984070b1</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 29 Jun 2023 04:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本周是《直男烧杯》上线一周年。从为什么要做两性情感类播客，到最喜欢的往期单集，三个男人一起聊聊做播客一年来里里外外奇奇怪怪的经历。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在某音频平台是颈部大V 、粉丝拥趸众多的贝奥，在小宇宙屡屡被骂；仲甫推动播客第一期节目上线，是为了和刚认识的姑娘有话聊；当然被播客影响最大的还是曹老板，他通过做播客找到了女朋友。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎微信搜索 straightsbeaker 加听友群</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="104">01:44</a> &nbsp;为什么想要做一个两性情感类播客？三个人各自的版本</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="651">10:51</a> &nbsp;每次听自己的节目有什么感受？贝奥：在别的平台做惯了大V，被骂很不适应</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1192">19:52</a> &nbsp;最喜欢哪一期？仲甫和曹老板都选择了</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/62c511114b51051a317a4c0b" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/62c511114b51051a317a4c0b"><span>《爹味大赏：直男发现青春期的女儿看黄片，该怎么办？》</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1403">23:23</a> &nbsp;最不喜欢哪一期</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1595">26:35</a> &nbsp;印象最深刻的一则留言</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2066">34:26</a> &nbsp;曹老板披肝沥胆：「我觉得人类历史呢……」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2317">38:37</a> &nbsp;三个主播是怎么互相认识的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2338">38:58</a> &nbsp;习惯了文字输出，播客作为内容形态有什么不一样的体验？仲甫：声音传递了文字不能表达的另一个我</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2657">44:17</a> &nbsp;做播客给生活带来什么改变？曹老板：我承认我跟一位女听友在一起了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3149">52:29</a> &nbsp;仲甫：播客是个自我展示的窗口</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3480">58:00</a> &nbsp;各自对播客的期望与规划</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3646">1:00:46</a> &nbsp;做播客一年，曹老板对两性议题的思考</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3886">1:04:46</a> &nbsp;听友提问：三位主播的人设有百分之多少是源自真实的自己呢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4092">1:08:12</a> &nbsp;听友提问：如果可以邀请任何人对谈，最想邀请的人是谁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4216">1:10:16</a> &nbsp;听友提问：三位主播会不会考虑结婚？贝奥因为女友在侧，吞吞吐吐</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目中提到的往期节目：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="249">04:09</a> &nbsp;不能上线的节目：</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/YlWtQm0ta_PuF_djQzCpXQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/YlWtQm0ta_PuF_djQzCpXQ"><span>《女友使用情趣玩具，直男会有压力吗？如果是 ChatGPT 加成的情趣机器人呢？》</span></a><span>，点击跳转公众号收听</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1210">20:10</a> &nbsp;曹老板和仲甫最喜欢的单集：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/62c511114b51051a317a4c0b" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/62c511114b51051a317a4c0b"><span>《爹味大赏：直男发现青春期的女儿看黄片，该怎么办？》</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1273">21:13</a> &nbsp;贝奥最喜欢的单集，被骂了一千多条评论：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/63c0ece6eab1781ef439c092" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/63c0ece6eab1781ef439c092"><span>《性别博士女权播主 vs. 极右保守直男主播，两个小时的对话后会有共识吗？》</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1351">22:31</a> &nbsp;播放量最高的单集，上了小宇宙最热榜：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/62ceaa1764f141ad815011e1" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/62ceaa1764f141ad815011e1"><span>《阳痿是中年男人的福报吗？三位中年直男坦诚相告》</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1383">23:03</a> &nbsp;仲甫聊得最爽的单集：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/62eb8f4443b4708e023e2e3b" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/62eb8f4443b4708e023e2e3b"><span>《滚床单前读数学书助兴？三位直男聊亲密关系中的精神生活》</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1403">23:23</a> &nbsp;曹老板最不喜欢的单集：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6305f72cc8cc641fd9084a18" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6305f72cc8cc641fd9084a18"><span>《直男如何学习成为女权主义者？头部播客主播给三个直男下乡支教》</span></a><span>，因为停留在一些形而上术语的争论上</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2168">36:08</a> &nbsp;贝奥单飞的播客单集：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/630205d8c854435dfbd1c6dd" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/630205d8c854435dfbd1c6dd"><span>《自由女权和激进女权的核心区别》</span></a></p>]]></description>
